# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own key. Restart `expo start` after
# editing — env vars are read at bundler start, not hot-reloaded.
#
# Used by the scanner (architecture.md #14-17) to read medicine packaging
# photos via OpenAI's vision API.
#
# SECURITY: EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined into the shipped JS bundle in
# plain text — readable by anyone who inspects the app. Acceptable here only
# because this is a personal, non-distributed app; a distributed app must
# proxy this call through a backend instead (see architecture.md #32).
EXPO_PUBLIC_OPENAI_API_KEY=
